{"id":1782640656937,"text":"他的父亲是那个异国的一个君主","sender":"me","time":"17:59","timestamp":1782640783997,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55759},{"id":1782640656938,"text":"然后他父亲就威胁他说，他必须要得到那个国家皇帝的宠爱，然后必须要骗走他的心，要不然就把主控他妈杀了","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640812651,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55760},{"id":1782640656939,"text":"主控被逼无奈","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640816839,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55761},{"id":1782640656940,"text":"如果是利用的话，我倒没有这么心痛","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640829570,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55762},{"id":1782640656941,"text":"关键这个国家的皇帝是一个明君","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640834262,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55763},{"id":1782640656942,"text":"而且他这个人很温柔","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640838615,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55764},{"id":1782640656943,"text":"然后对主控超级好","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640842378,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55765},{"id":1782640656944,"text":"是真的没亏待过主控","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640847627,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55766},{"id":1782640656945,"text":"虽然主控不是他们国家的人","sender":"me","time":"18:00","timestamp":1782640853885,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55767},{"id":1782640656946,"text":"然后主控不能当他们国家的皇后","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640860038,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55768},{"id":1782640656947,"text":"最高只能当贵妃","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640864000,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55769},{"id":1782640656948,"text":"但是那个皇帝愿意为了主控，打破这个规矩","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640874889,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55770},{"id":1782640656949,"text":"然后很多大臣都在那里说这个皇帝","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640881117,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55771},{"id":1782640656950,"text":"但是他说主控更重要","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640886554,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55772},{"id":1782640656951,"text":"他要让天下人都知道他很爱主控","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640894616,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55773},{"id":1782640656952,"text":"两个人就是有点像那个苏妲己和纣王","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640905369,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55774},{"id":1782640656953,"text":"但是这个皇帝最开始是明君","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640913041,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55775},{"id":1782640656954,"text":"后来是因为主控，然后慢慢变得有点偏执，然后开始昏庸","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640921137,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55776},{"id":1782640656955,"text":"最后开始只在意主控，不在意他的国家","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640926925,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55777},{"id":1782640656956,"text":"然后最后两个人一起被叛军烧死","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640935687,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55778},{"id":1782640656957,"text":"最痛的是结局，你知道吗？","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640940025,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55779},{"id":1782640656958,"text":"两个人在临死的时候","sender":"me","time":"18:03","timestamp":1782641002254,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55780},{"id":1782640656959,"text":"但是那个时候没有标注是谁说的话","sender":"me","time":"18:03","timestamp":1782641009949,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55781},{"id":1782640656960,"text":"所以无法判断下面这些是主控说的，还是那个皇帝说的","sender":"me","time":"18:03","timestamp":1782641018656,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55782},{"id":1782640656961,"text":"“若有来生，你会真心爱我吗？”","sender":"me","time":"18:03","timestamp":1782641026954,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"“若有来生，你会真心爱我吗？”","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55783},{"id":1782640656962,"text":"“若有来生，我希望与你不再相逢，不再相知，不再相爱，不再相欠”","sender":"me","time":"18:05","timestamp":1782641107401,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55784},{"id":1782640656963,"text":"“ 那便一同，留在此生，万劫不复”","sender":"me","time":"18:06","timestamp":1782641218483,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55785},{"id":1782640656964,"text":"可是，我甚至不敢，也没有机会问一句","sender":"me","time":"18:07","timestamp":1782641233494,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55786},{"id":1782640656965,"text":"你有没有真心爱过我？","sender":"me","time":"18:07","timestamp":1782641241258,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55787}]